Here's everything that's changed recently. A Brand-New Look Redesigned battle layout: Flowers and Fu Cards now sit in a row above the table, with cleaner side panels New animated \"flowing ink clouds\" background, which shifts its colors to match each Boss The Shop now opens right on the table: buy and sell on the left, spin the wheel on the right. Drag Flowers to reorder them, and sell Fu Cards directly Refreshed main menu with the flo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T15:12:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695668","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:25:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4881270-1844751498231658","game_id":"steam-4881270","kind":"update","title":"Update Notes: Enchants, Cultivation Levels and the New-Player Experience","summary":"Thank you to everyone who played and sent feedback. These notes cover everything added since August. Cultivation levels When a run ends (cleared, failed or abandoned), your total score for that run is converted into experience towards a permanent Cultivation level. Higher realms give more experience: Mortal ×1.0 Beginning ×1.15 Minor ×1.30 Major ×1.45 Abyss ×1.60 The level cap is 40. Reaching certain levels unlocks starting bonuses, and these stack: LevelReward Lv2Starting coins +1 Lv5Start with","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T14:34:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498231658","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:25:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4881270-1836506165570086","game_id":"steam-4881270","kind":"announcement","title":"Friendlier for Newcomers: Assist Mode, Brightness, Reworked Tutorial & Routes","summary":"♟ An Update Built for New PlayersAssist Mode A new Assist Mode toggle (switch it anytime in Settings; you'll also be asked on first launch). When on, every tile shows a small badge on top — numbers for suited tiles, letters for honors (Winds = E/S/W/N, and R/G/W for the dragons) — so you can read your hand at a glance even without knowing the tile faces.Fully Reworked Tutorial The tutorial has been redesigned to be more focused and easier to follow: it highlights exactly which tiles to tap, step","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-03T10:22:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165570086","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:25:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4881270-1836506165558363","game_id":"steam-4881270","kind":"update","title":"Quality-of-Life Update | Smoother Rewards & a Friendlier Tutorial","summary":"Hey everyone! Thanks for all your feedback — this update focuses on smoother gameplay and a better first-time experience. 🀄🎴 Smoother Rewards ScreenThe end-of-table rewards now reveal line by line for a better sense of pacingIn a hurry? Click anywhere to skip the animation instantly and grab your rewardsCoins now count up with an animation when you claim, so your gains feel more rewarding📖 A More Complete TutorialAdded explanations for Suited Tiles & Honor Tiles — learn how base scores and multi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-28T15:25:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165558363","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:25:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4881270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:54:27Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:54:26Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4881270":"2026-10-26T14:54:27Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4881270":{"las